name: Bug report
description: Something behaves differently from what is documented
labels: [bug]
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Thanks for the report. A failing command pasted verbatim is worth more
        than a description of it — most reports are resolved from the output.
  - type: textarea
    id: what-happened
    attributes:
      label: What happened
      description: The behaviour you observed, and what you expected instead.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: steps
    attributes:
      label: Steps to reproduce
      description: The smallest sequence that shows the problem.
      placeholder: |
        1. …
        2. …
        3. …
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: output
    attributes:
      label: Relevant output
      description: Command output or logs, redacted of secrets.
      render: shell
    validations:
      required: false
  - type: input
    id: version
    attributes:
      label: Version or commit
      description: The release tag, or the commit the problem was observed on.
    validations:
      required: true
